message: "If you use this code, please cite the article."
title: "Code for: Large Language Model Agents for Evidence Based Genetic Disease Severity Classification"
abstract: "Code, data and saved outputs for the HPO severity classification study: the classification agent and its source-verification step, the no-retrieval baseline, model selection, gene-level severity aggregation, comparison with clinical gene lists and the figure scripts. One command recomputes the manuscript's numbers from the saved outputs without calling a language model."
